    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/664129346b27ab9f38432dbdd9727c89.poster.avif?t=1753486516\" width=612 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/664129346b27ab9f38432dbdd9727c89.webm?t=1753486516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/664129346b27ab9f38432dbdd9727c89.mp4?t=1753486516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A JRPG sequel to Diana's Quest 1 but with 11 clothes. Each has a unique skill set for learning and playing in different styles. This adventure takes place after the princess saves her kingdom. There is a customized system to choose boobs sizes and hair colors, both impacting the CGs/portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/defb13b0d5ee29f95ac86681e1d06dc8.webp?t=1753486516\" width=616 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/a379e28885c1f5909f065378a86676db.webp?t=1753486516\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Clothing System with 11 outfits and unique skills to learn for each one;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/a379e28885c1f5909f065378a86676db.webp?t=1753486516\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Explore a Fantasy World;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/a379e28885c1f5909f065378a86676db.webp?t=1753486516\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Anime Style;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/a379e28885c1f5909f065378a86676db.webp?t=1753486516\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Customize System with 3 different types of boobs to choose and 3 hair colors that impacts the CGs/portraits;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/a379e28885c1f5909f065378a86676db.webp?t=1753486516\" width=17 height=18 /></span>A Classic JRPG combat with turned-based battle;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/c2551cf1bc1f25fccf1983b9d656399b.poster.avif?t=1753486516\" width=612 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/c2551cf1bc1f25fccf1983b9d656399b.webm?t=1753486516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/c2551cf1bc1f25fccf1983b9d656399b.mp4?t=1753486516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125080/extras/2075b71bcf47e3815e9e6e249a40a288.webp?t=1753486516\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
